    <item>
      <title>जातकर्म</title>
      <link>https://vishvAsa.github.io/vedAH_yajuH/taittirIyam/sUtram/ApastambaH/gRhyam/paddhatiH/vishvAsaH/saMskAraH/jAtakarma/</link>
